  "behavior": [
    "Repeated picks add complete rows. Both selects their union. Toggle exchanges U/V and leaves Both unchanged.",
    "Source closest UV parameters choose the largest non-rational tensor-product basis factor. Periodic and closed aliases share a logical control.",
    "Cancellation retains accepted picks and preferences. Source selection is released after command completion; unrelated ordinary preselection survives.",
    "Selection and grip display preserve geometry, attributes, Undo and Redo. Batch input is validated before display/selection changes."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "HideOthers is parsed and remembered; captured states keep all object/grip visibility. General native mouse display effects remain unqualified.",
    "Native mouse picking through trimmed/overlapping faces, exact basis-boundary ties, extreme or non-clamped layouts, SubD and individual hidden grips require further validation.",
    "No performance parity claim; native elapsed fields are driver placeholders."
  ],
  "validation_note": "Both release replays and final portable UI/core checks use final source. The native UI check preceded an equivalent point-input boolean simplification, also checked by final all-feature Clippy."
}
